{
  "job_B24.12.2_20260920_210400": {
    "text": "Noes earc w\u00e6s \u00fereo hund f\u00e6\u00fema lang, & fiftiges wid & \u00feritiges heah.\nHer secg\u00fe \u00fe\u00e6ra tweigra scea\u00feena naman \u00fee mid criste hangodon.\nOn ebreisc hig hatton acharica & macres, & on grecisc macha & iacha, & on romanisc ismus & dismus.\nIsmus gelyfde & dysmus ne gelyfde.\nSanctus petrus cyrice ys \u00fereo hund fota lang & twa hund wid, & twa hund swera & twentig, & \u00fe\u00e6ra\nSalomones templ ys sixtig f\u00e6\u00fema lang, & sixtig heah & \u00feryttiges wid.\nAnd \u00fe\u00e6ra wyrhtena w\u00e6s \u00fee \u00fe\u00e6ne stan b\u00e6ron hund seofontig \u00feusenda, & hund eohtig \u00feusenda hyne\nAnd \u00feer w\u00e6s \u00fereo \u00feusend gerefena, & \u00fereo hundr\u00e6d.",
